    <!-- ===================================================== the lit mark
         DESIGN_SYSTEM.md Part A, Brand: the one dimensional rendering of the
         Causeway geometry, for the big moments (the end of a sprint since
         #431; first run and the end of the trial may use it too). Made once,
         from design/brand/basalt-mark-lit.svg, which this copies face for
         face: the same polygons as the flat mark, each face lit from one
         light above (tops brightest, sides darker toward their feet), and a
         soft contact shadow. Fixed greys like the flat mark, not tokens: it is
         the same in both themes. Never redraw the flat mark from this. -->
